abstract: |-
  deploy2zenodo provides two shell scripts to deploy your data to
  Zenodo or Invenio RDM instances. You can use them in a CI pipeline as an
  automatic workflow.

  Both scripts can be configured via environment variables
  or an optional config file.

  Depending on the selected flags, the data can be curated before
  deployment in a merge request, in the zenodo web interface
  or not curated at all.
